{"id":"NCT06143956","title":"A Master Protocol Study (LY900038) of Multiple Intervention-Specific-Appendices (ISAs) in Adult Participants With Obesity or Overweight","official":"A Master Protocol for a Randomized, Controlled, Clinical Trial of Multiple Interventions for Chronic Weight Management in Adult Participants With Obesity or Overweight","summary":"The purpose of this Phase-2 chronic weight management master protocol (CWMM) is to create a framework to evaluate the safety and efficacy of various investigational interventions for chronic weight management with intervention-specific appendices (ISAs). The CWMM establishes entry criteria for newly enrolled participants across the master and the ISAs. The ISAs may start independently of other ISAs as interventions become available for clinical testing. The results for the CWMM screening record will be reported when all the ISA's complete.","conditions":["Obesity","Overweight"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"LY3305677"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"LY3841136"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Tirzepatide"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"LY3549492"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"LY3532226"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Have a body mass index (BMI)\n\n  * ≥30 kilogram/square meter (kg/m²), or\n  * ≥27 kg/m² and \\<30 kg/m², or with at least 1 weight-related comorbidity\n* Have had a stable body weight for the 3 months prior to randomization (\\<5%) body weight gain and/or loss.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Have a prior or planned surgical treatment for obesity, except prior liposuction or abdominoplasty, if performed \\>1 year prior to screening.\n* Have type 1 diabetes mellitus, latent autoimmune diabetes in adults, or history of ketoacidosis or hyperosmolar coma.\n* Have poorly controlled hypertension.\n* Have signs and symptoms of any liver disease other than nonalcoholic fatty liver disease.\n* Have any of the following cardiovascular conditions within 3 months prior to screening:\n\n  * acute myocardial infarction\n  * cerebrovascular accident (stroke)\n  * unstable angina, or\n  * hospitalization due to congestive heart failure.\n* Have a history of symptomatic gallbladder disease within the past 2 years.\n* Have a lifetime history of suicide attempts.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"75 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"SCREENING","enrollment":1481,"start":"2023-11-17","pcd":"2027-09","upd":"2026-10-07","sponsor":"Eli Lilly and Company","areas":["other"],"central":["Trial questions or participation questions: 1-877-CTLILLY (1-877-285-4559) or · 1-317-615-4559 · LillyTrials@Lilly.com","Physicians interested in becoming principal investigators please contact · clinical_inquiry_hub@lilly.com"],"sites":[{"f":"The Institute for Liver Health II dba Arizona Clinical Trials - Mesa","city":"Chandler","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85225","s":"R","lat":33.3062,"lon":-111.8413,"c":""},{"f":"HOPE Research Institute","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85032","s":"STOP","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":""},{"f":"Headlands Research - Scottsdale","city":"Scottsdale","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85260","s":"R","lat":33.5092,"lon":-111.899,"c":"480-725-8708"},{"f":"The Institute for Liver Health II dba Arizona Liver Health-Tucson","city":"Tucson","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85712","s":"R","lat":32.2217,"lon":-110.9265,"c":"480-470-4000"},{"f":"NorCal Medical Research, Inc","city":"Greenbrae","pr":"California","zip":"94904","s":"R","lat":37.9485,"lon":-122.5247,"c":"415-461-1585"},{"f":"Velocity Clinical Research, Huntington Park","city":"Huntington Park","pr":"California","zip":"90255","s":"R","lat":33.9817,"lon":-118.2251,"c":"323-588-1990"},{"f":"Peninsula Research Associates","city":"Rolling Hills Estates","pr":"California","zip":"90274","s":"R","lat":33.7878,"lon":-118.3581,"c":"310-265-1623"},{"f":"Diablo Clinical Research, Inc.","city":"Walnut Creek","pr":"California","zip":"94598","s":"R","lat":37.9063,"lon":-